{"title": "Emma", "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"druid-infobox druid-container noexcerpt\" id=\"druid-container-1\"><div><div class=\"druid-title\">Emma</div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div class=\"druid-main-image\"><div class=\"druid-main-images-labels druid-tabs\"><div class=\"druid-main-images-label druid-tab druid-toggleable druid-title-tab focused\" data-druid=\"1-1\" data-druid-tab-key=\"In-Game\">In-Game</div></div><a href=\"/wiki/File:Emma.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Emma.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/Emma.jpg/250px-Emma.jpg?857cae\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"141\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Emma.jpg/375px-Emma.jpg?857cae 1.5x, /images/thumb/Emma.jpg/500px-Emma.jpg?857cae 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Information\">Information</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-VariantOf\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-VariantOf\">Variant Of</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-VariantOf druid-data-nonempty\">\nGhost Girl</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-InternalID\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-InternalID\">Internal ID</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-InternalID druid-data-nonempty\">\nHangedGirlEnemy</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-MaxCount\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-MaxCount\">Max Count</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-MaxCount druid-data-nonempty\">\n1</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-PowerLevel\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-PowerLevel\">Power Level</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-PowerLevel druid-data-nonempty\">\n2</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-CauseofDeath\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-CauseofDeath\">Cause of Death</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-CauseofDeath druid-data-nonempty\">\nUnknown</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-IsBodyRecoverable\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-IsBodyRecoverable\">Is Body Recoverable?</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-IsBodyRecoverable druid-data-nonempty\">\nYes</div></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Stats\">Stats</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Health\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Health\">Health</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Health druid-data-nonempty\">\nUnkillable</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Damage\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Damage\">Damage</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Damage druid-data-nonempty\">\nInstant Kill</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-DoorSpeedMultiplier\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-DoorSpeedMultiplier\">Door Speed Multiplier</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-DoorSpeedMultiplier druid-data-nonempty\">\nIrrelevant</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-StunTimeMultiplier\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-StunTimeMultiplier\">Stun Time Multiplier</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-StunTimeMultiplier druid-data-nonempty\">\nImmune</div></div></div></div>\n<p><b>Emma</b> is a hostile entity and variant of the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://lethal.miraheze.org/wiki/Ghost_Girl\">Ghost Girl</a> added by <b>Wesley's Ememy Variants</b>. This entity is not to be confused with the other appearances of <b>Emma</b> during <a href=\"/wiki/Weathers#&gt;_Forsaken\" title=\"Weathers\"> <b>Forsaken</b></a> weather or <span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span> the unique trial found on the exterior of <a href=\"/wiki/Roart\" title=\"Roart\"><b>Roart</b></a></span></span>. She is a young girl with a white dress, pale grey skin, long black hair, hollowed out eyes, and a noose around her neck.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Mechanics\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Mechanics\">&gt; Mechanics</span></h2>\n<p>There is little to no difference between the Ghost Girl and <b>Emma</b>. She will appear behind her targeted player always accompanied by the sound of her hanging, muffling the player's audio if they look at her. After her targeted player has looked at her at least twice or ignored her at least three times, approaching, looking, or staring at her can cause her to begin chasing that player. She will decapitate and instantly kill that player on contact.\n</p><p>There can be confusion on which <b>Emma</b> is the real entity versus the harmless and spooky jumpscares she does during <a href=\"/wiki/Weathers#&gt;_Forsaken\" title=\"Weathers\"> <b>Forsaken</b></a> weather. However, players can always tell if she's the real entity depending on if she appears behind them, if their audio is muffled while looking at her, if only one player sees her at that time, and if this encounter happens later in the day. She can also still be cheesed by phasing into and crouching on top of the cupboard in the ship.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Spawn_Condition\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Spawn_Condition\">&gt; Spawn Condition</span></h2>\n<p><b>Emma</b> will spawn at exactly 02:00pm on a moon during <a href=\"/wiki/Weathers#&gt;_Forsaken\" title=\"Weathers\"> <b>Forsaken</b></a> weather. This spawn does not contribute to total Power Level. \n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Bury_the_Child_Videotape\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Bury_the_Child_Videotape\">&gt; Bury the Child Videotape</span></h2>\n<p>While <b>Emma</b> does not have a bestiary or journal entry, this videotape does provide a little context on who she is. It is randomly available for purchase in the Gift Shop on <a href=\"/wiki/Galetry\" title=\"Galetry\"><b>Galetry</b></a> and <span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span>is only supposed to unlock <a href=\"/wiki/Roart\" title=\"Roart\"><b>Roart</b></a> during Halloween season.</span></span>\n</p><p><video poster=\"/images/thumb/BuryTheChildTape.mp4/500px--BuryTheChildTape.mp4.jpg?720c79\" controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" class=\"thumbborder\" width=\"500\" height=\"281\" data-durationhint=\"27\" data-mwtitle=\"BuryTheChildTape.mp4\" data-mwprovider=\"local\" style=\"max-width:100%;max-height:100%;height:100%\"><source src=\"/images/BuryTheChildTape.mp4?720c79\" type=\"video/mp4; codecs=&quot;avc1.42E01E, mp4a.40.2&quot;\" data-width=\"1280\" data-height=\"720\" /></video>\n</p>\n<table class=\"article-table mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Text <span style=\"padding-left:0.5em;\">&#x2060;</span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<table style=\"border: 15px solid #8E8E83; font-size: 135%; font-family: Tomorrow; color: #01A801; border-spacing: 0px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 25px; background-color: #151515;\">We are the hands that bury the deceased, you are the shovel that keep the hands from getting stained. We cannot allow the deceased to control who lives and who dies. Find the forsaken child, dispose of her body and we will let you out.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Audio\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Audio\">&gt; Audio</span></h2>\n<p>Note that some of this audio may be difficult to hear in-game due to the muffling applied while looking at or being chased by <b>Emma</b>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"text-align: center;\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<caption style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">Audio\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Action</th>\n<th>Sound\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Appearing</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"6\" data-mwtitle=\"Appearsound.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/Appearsound.mp3?3bacb5\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/Appearsound.mp3/Appearsound.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hanging</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"16\" data-mwtitle=\"HangingChoke.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/HangingChoke.mp3?1f8de6\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/HangingChoke.mp3/HangingChoke.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bell Chime</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"22\" data-mwtitle=\"Bellchim2.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/Bellchim2.mp3?d264d2\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/Bellchim2.mp3/Bellchim2.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Chasing</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"6\" data-mwtitle=\"HangingChase.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/HangingChase.mp3?409fc3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/HangingChase.mp3/HangingChase.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Gallery\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Gallery\">&gt; Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:EmmaStalk.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"Emma stalking a player at a distance.\"><img alt=\"Emma stalking a player at a distance.\" src=\"/images/thumb/EmmaStalk.jpg/120px-EmmaStalk.jpg?4cc7fe\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/EmmaStalk.jpg/180px-EmmaStalk.jpg?4cc7fe 1.5x, /images/thumb/EmmaStalk.jpg/240px-EmmaStalk.jpg?4cc7fe 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Emma stalking a player at a distance.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:EmmaChase.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"Emma chasing a player.\"><img alt=\"Emma chasing a player.\" src=\"/images/thumb/EmmaChase.jpg/120px-EmmaChase.jpg?b0eb66\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/EmmaChase.jpg/180px-EmmaChase.jpg?b0eb66 1.5x, /images/thumb/EmmaChase.jpg/240px-EmmaChase.jpg?b0eb66 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Emma chasing a player.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n</ul></div>", "images": ["Emma.jpg", "EmmaStalk.jpg", "EmmaChase.jpg", "BuryTheChildTape.mp4", "Appearsound.mp3", "HangingChoke.mp3", "Bellchim2.mp3", "HangingChase.mp3"], "cats": ["Pages_with_DRUID_infoboxes", "Pages_with_spoilers"]}